                                         "text":  "=Task: {{ $json.task }}\n\nIf the task is \"summary\", write at most 5 short lines:\n1. What the job is: one plain sentence on the day-to-day work.\n2. Key facts: years of experience, work type, location, pay (or \"not mentioned\").\n3. Top skills or certifications asked for (max 5).\n4. Rules missed: for each field listed here [{{ $json.missing }}], give your best guess from the text, marked \"(AI guess)\". If the list is empty, write \"Rules found everything.\"\n5. One line: anything unusual or important (deadline, travel, visa, language).\n\nText:\n{{ $json.text }}",
                                         "options":  {
                                                         "systemMessage":  "You are the Job OS Brain, an assistant for one job seeker.\nRules you never break:\n- Use only facts from the text you are given. Never invent experience, skills or details.\n- If something is not in the text, say \"not mentioned\".\n- Plain, short English. No hype words.\n"
